.be/p-L0NpaErkk\" data-code=\"p-L0NpaErkk\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/p-L0NpaErkk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-04T15:49:01-07:00","id":1401009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1401002-who-should-rule-chicago-in-2021#post1401002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Critias is probably the guy who SHOULD be Prince but he's only recently broken out of 2000 years of mind-control and is toadying up to a guy who isn't even as old as what I'm sure some of his socks are.<br /> <br /> Anita would make an awesome Baron but I'm not sure I think she can pull off being Baron of Chicago. East Chicago is more her speed.<br /> <br /> Tyler could be Baron of Chicago. Adze could also be Baron as he's old enough and powerful enough to be ruler.<br /> <br /> I think poor Kevin is doomed, though. He's dreaming very big but he is flying too close to the sun.<br /> <br /> I also don't see Olaf One-Eye returning to power.<br /> <br /> I could see Son actually getting into the big chair if he diablerizes someone else important or betrays Kevin Jackson at a critical moment.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Let's see:<br /> <br /> Critias doesn't want the title. Most elders understand that being prince is as much an hassle as it is a benefit so he's perfectly fine with KJ ruling as he was fine with Lodin before him.<br /> <br /> Anita doesn't have the personal power to hold the position and Chicago is the most &quot;Camarilla&quot; of all the cities in the States so... no chance.<br /> <br /> Tyler is not even in Chicago anymore. And if she realized that Helena is there she'll stay away.<br /> <br /> Adze has potential as he's got money and information but in order to become prince he would have to go against most of the status quo and win. Not likely he'd be able to.<br /> <br /> Olaf's days on the throne of Chicago are done. He failed and the mere fact he allowed himself to be kidnapped by the Sabbat and revealed Camarilla secrets to them makes him a prime target for retribution from the higer ups of the sect the moment he reveals himself.<br /> <br /> Son is perfectly content having someone else being prince and having time for his &quot;hobbies&quot;...<br /> <br /> Seems to me for the time being Kevin Jackson stays prince. He's young and weak enough that the elders of the primogen do not feel threatened by him so for them supporting him is just like supporting a weaker Lodin, which for most of them is ideal.<br /> <br /> Unless...<br /> <br /> Apparently Maxwell is now Baron of Gary. That's not saying much but he's always wanted to get back to rule Chicago and he's got the personal power to deal with most of the vampires in the city (in previous editions he was more powerful than Lodin) and the charisma to unite the Anarchs into a powerful fighting force. I could see him emerging victorious after a long campaign against the Camarilla. Unlikely but possible. It would take him years though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-04T16:30:23-07:00","id":1401013,"title":"","content":"Axl Blood, the Anarch warlord who now rules Chicago with his trusty titanium baseball bat.<br /> <br /> Alternately, the ghost of former Mayor Richard J. Daley, who is possessing whoever claims the throne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-09T15:06:09-07:00","id":1401975,"title":"","content":"I find the best argument for the Anarchs came from one of my old STs who got rid of all morality in it.<br /> <br /> PC: The Anarchs aren't any better than the Camarilla.<br /> <br /> Baron: Nope.<br /> <br /> PC: What?<br /> <br /> Baron: The Anarchs exist because we don't have power and they do. This isn't the Rebellion vs. the Empire this is the Godfather, son. We're going to overthrow the Prince so we can be rich and safe. It's about the power and the money. If you want to die with a boot on your face, that's you. But I'd rather live like kings and the only way to do that is to make a space for yourself at the top.<br /> <br /> I feel this will mean who will actually be the first Anarch ruler of Chicago.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-09-2020, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-18T03:22:37-07:00","id":1403362,"title":"","content":"The argument the Anarchs most often make (in my games at least) is that they stand for freedom while the Camarilla stands for tyranny. The Anarchs don't want to be controlled by their sires and by the smothering institution that the Ivory Tower is. Most of them want to be able to hunt where they please, sire who they want, have access to resources otherwise denied to them and not having to kiss some old fart's butt to be given the smallest of favors.<br /> <br /> From their point of view these are sensible positions. From the Camarilla's they are a threat instead. And from a human standpoint it's not really better than what the Camarilla does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24992-haquim","name":"Haquim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}